<!-- NTK: the light theme, from brand/palette.json ("keyboard.light"). Paper
     background; keys are blocks as on the site: a white top face, a lit face
     below and a shaded face at the right in light greys, a soft drop; function
     keys a slightly darker grey top. Black legends; orange only on the Sign key
     and in the badge (TODO.md 3.7, 8). The app's buttons, cards and fields keep
     the flat look (face, stepped edge, hard shadow; a press darkens them). -->
